flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6022023Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6022778Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6023166Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6023523Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6024811Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6025313Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6025636Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6026304Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6026615Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6027093Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6027680Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6028201Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6028637Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6028846Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6029099Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6029569Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6029823Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6030250Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6030406Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6030527Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6030740Z 
