flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6037615Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:32:22.6037926Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
